      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "我万没有想到。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I had never expected it at all.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "the-old-capital-p03053",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "两人也望了望我。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "The two of them also glanced at me.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "the-old-capital-p03053",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "我在女佣的引领下，来到了一间宽敞的房间里，只见大竹七段独自坐在那里。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Led by the maid, I came into a spacious room and saw that Otake, seventh dan, was sitting there alone.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "the-old-capital-p03053",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "虽有火盆，房间还是冷飕飕的。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Although there was a brazier, the room was still chilly.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
